@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create an empty KnowledgeBase for one service
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-bases
Content-Type: application/json

{"key":"checkout-service","name":"Checkout Service","description":"Operational runbooks"}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("knowledgeBaseId", response.body.id);
%}

### Get a KnowledgeBase
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-bases/{{knowledgeBaseId}}

### List KnowledgeBases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-bases?page=0&size=20
